  "remarks": "Alina Nikishaeva is the Head of the Simferopol military-patriotic club “Battalion Forpost,” operating in the temporarily occupied territory of Crimea under Russian state-supported youth and patriotic education initiatives. The club promotes pro-Russian patriotism and militarised values among children and adolescents, contributing to the ideological indoctrination of minors, including those from occupied territories of Ukraine.",
